      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_82557194e87c97183939540bcbfd309fdd5d8363c7894d2ca3a76c5266070349"
      ],
      "text": "Vibra Code is an open-source AI app builder: users describe mobile apps in plain English, a backend runs Claude Code inside an E2B cloud sandbox to generate apps, and a live preview appears on the phone."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_da348189e82c6d871ea166c3aeea220bba0ab26e0974ddd3ba249d3b87364a3a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c",
          "git_sha": "2992a099a54651aa06172b78879a8b723101b885",
          "line_end": 140,
          "line_start": 132,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "sa4hnd/vibra-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/sa4hnd/vibra-code/blob/0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c/README.md#L132-L140"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_46d3e680f887f64bf1aba25cec3df3ce0fa32b6ac5338db8859ad1fd796d57be"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture diagram shows three tiers: an Expo iOS app talking over an API to a Next.js + Convex server, which queues work via Inngest to an E2B sandbox running the AI agent."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_79062d92b4b0075f561ad1c80f8f1dd3a935486c9abb070efaf93bdcbdbae02a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c",
          "git_sha": "2992a099a54651aa06172b78879a8b723101b885",
          "line_end": 147,
          "line_start": 142,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "sa4hnd/vibra-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/sa4hnd/vibra-code/blob/0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c/README.md#L142-L147"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_17775aa237a2217b0aed11f55f1890bb6c617e2ad7340a0cb849380bbbc912ac"
      ],
      "text": "Documented flow: the backend creates a Convex session, Inngest spawns an E2B sandbox where the AI agent generates code, updates stream back via Convex, and the phone opens a live preview through a tunnel URL."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d6d41f0cd3270c0f3df8d842973b47e73926df195c37e0635240ce3d1650bb02",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
