          "line_end": 162,
          "line_start": 162,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "sa4hnd/vibra-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/sa4hnd/vibra-code/blob/0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c/README.md#L162-L162"
        },
        {
          "commit": "0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c",
          "git_sha": "2992a099a54651aa06172b78879a8b723101b885",
          "line_end": 160,
          "line_start": 155,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "sa4hnd/vibra-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/sa4hnd/vibra-code/blob/0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c/README.md#L155-L160"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5ee0aaa1039053f0eb08a794e556b59ad66f025d7e1e0fe0257afed3d29a3580",
        "slc_ecd861d18e3e9aa421fd0848720f9bbc88374c29ed49163fb29e7108d2fdad64"
      ],
      "text": "Required configuration includes ANTHROPIC_API_KEY for AI generation, E2B_API_KEY for sandboxes, Clerk keys for authentication, and a Convex deployment URL; Stripe and RevenueCat keys are optional, only for payments."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5625c342cdfd7f6e6a0b8c3a6f3f1b6eb387742043d92186fde32e3de7859cc9",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c",
          "git_sha": "2992a099a54651aa06172b78879a8b723101b885",
          "line_end": 102,
          "line_start": 102,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "sa4hnd/vibra-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/sa4hnd/vibra-code/blob/0a8524a68899e7d98bdd12787f624fdcd062c74c/README.md#L102-L102"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_188a3d6462cd1cabab888dfb48d782efbf623eca06081d5934e705a63d2db01d"
      ],
      "text": "The product supports multiple AI providers — Claude (default), Cursor, and Gemini — switchable with a single environment variable."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1d9380c1291c81122dadb9580c9a762d3e92d3f7676a016cd0c487d38887e7d7",
