        "slc_ea245923ccf46f44e472522c24db37f20a9e928c26e8e0835db93ba1cb27fa78"
      ],
      "text": "The mobile app's core is a native iOS chat UI built with Texture (AsyncDisplayKit) and IGListKit, described as off-main-thread rendering targeting 60fps scrolling."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d0c23800c7a6a68117821473a482035ed58133629e9448735eb5c0bf7e4b53dd",
