        "slc_0d2213bbd310440f07253bb4638171bb6fa7559f093ab1d5f658f3e1e5a6f6dd"
      ],
      "text": "The iOS client exposes modals for selecting the AI provider, browsing generated files, viewing live sandbox logs, publishing to GitHub, haptic settings, and editing environment variables."
    },
